  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH Settings Navigation Scroll",
      "text": "为 DSH Web 设置弹窗左侧导航增加纵向滚动能力。当安装的插件较多、设置分区超出视口时，导航栏会显示细滚动条，所有设置入口都可滚动访问。\n\nAdds vertical scrolling to the left navigation of the DSH Web settings dialog. When installed plugins create more settings sections than fit in the viewport, every entry remains reachable through a visible scrollbar."
    },
    {
      "section": "特点",
      "text": "- 仅作用于 `[role=\"dialog\"] nav` 中包含按钮的设置导航。\n- 使用宿主主题变量，兼容明暗主题。\n- 不修改 DSH 核心文件，停用或卸载插件后样式自动移除。\n- 同时支持 Chromium/WebKit 和 Firefox 的滚动条样式。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:luxi233/dsh-settings-nav-scroll\n```\n\n安装后重启 DSH Web，并刷新浏览器页面。\n\nRestart DSH Web after installation, then refresh the browser page."
    },
    {
      "section": "验证",
      "text": "```powershell\nnpm test\nnpm run check\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "卸载",
      "text": "```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-settings-nav-scroll\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
